# Code owners for this repository.
#
# The Kepion org's `standard-repo-rules` ruleset sets require_code_owner_review
# on main, so this file determines whose approval a pull request needs. The
# last matching pattern wins, so the catch-all below owns everything.
#
# GitHub never lets a pull request's own author satisfy its review requirement,
# so a PR opened by the owner still needs a second reviewer.
#
# Any ONE of the owners below can satisfy the code-owner requirement, so a PR
# from a student or from one owner can be approved by any of the others.

